Package: benettris
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: networked Tetris game for V\OS
 BeNetTris is a falling-blocks (Tetris-style) game with network play:
 host or join a game over TCP with the Tetrinet protocol, talk on a
 party line and race on several fields at once. Single-player runs
 locally, with configurable control keys and block frequencies.
